1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Attest：面向 MCP 兼容型 AI Agent 的统一记忆治理中间层；经验须有证据方可写入，证据不足的交由人工审核。
A memory governance layer for MCP-compatible agents: evidence before admission, human review for the rest.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:24,000
能力 01 持续经验学习：从通过验证的任务中沉淀评审纠正过的经验，并在后续相关任务中按作用域召回注入。
Capability 01 Continuous Experience Learning: Each review correction becomes a verified lesson that is reused on related tasks.

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,133
新仓库。动手前，Claude 先调用 Attest 的 Recall（检索团队经验），查这个仓库有哪些已验证的经验。
A new repository. Before coding, Claude calls Attest's recall for the team's verified experience.

4
00:00:28,133 --> 00:00:37,133
结果是空的：这个仓库还没有任何已验证的经验，Agent 从零开始。
Nothing yet: the agent starts with no team knowledge.

5
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:42,066
让它实现退款函数 refund。
We ask it to implement refund().

6
00:00:42,066 --> 00:00:54,066
Claude 读完代码后确认：refund 已经满足任务要求，25 个测试全部通过。接下来进入代码评审。
Claude checks the code: refund() meets the task and all 25 tests pass. Next comes the code review.

7
00:00:54,066 --> 00:00:58,066
评审意见：动钱的操作必须防重复（带 idempotency_key），来源是重复退款事故 INC-204。测试通过后，Claude 调用 Learn（提交候选经验）。
Review: every money-moving operation must take an idempotency_key (incident INC-204). Tests pass; Claude calls Learn with a proposed note.

8
00:00:58,066 --> 00:01:10,066
Attest 不采信 AI 的说法：自己计算代码改动、自己跑测试，核对引用的话出自评审原文、规则落实在改动里。INC-204 是登记过的事故编号，属于硬证据，自动批准，存为 at-0002。
Attest computes the diff and runs the tests itself; the quote must come from the review and the rule must be in the change. INC-204 is a registered incident: approved as at-0002.

9
00:01:10,066 --> 00:01:26,066
能力 02 可信记忆与安全准入：经验写入前须经来源核验与证据判定：存在反证的拒绝，证据不足的转人工审核，不以智能体自述为依据。
Capability 02 Trusted Memory & Secure Admission: Nothing is stored on the AI's word: evidence first; bad notes are blocked, unclear ones go to a person.

10
00:01:26,066 --> 00:01:30,566
坏评审意见：把金额转成 float 再写审计。听起来合理，但金额用浮点会丢精度；而且没有测试检查它。
A bad review: write audit amounts as float. Sounds plausible, loses precision, and no test checks it.

11
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:38,566
这次 Claude 自己也起了疑心，先问要不要存。模型会不会发现，要看模型和运气。
This time Claude itself hesitated. Whether a model notices is down to the model, and to luck.

12
00:01:38,566 --> 00:01:42,666
按评审要求照做，测试照样通过，再调用 learn。
It follows the review; the tests still pass; it calls learn.

13
00:01:42,666 --> 00:01:52,666
Attest 不靠运气：团队代码检查发现金额被转成 float，判为 rejected，at-0003 直接退役，永远不会被推荐。只看测试的系统会把它收成规则。
Attest doesn't rely on luck: the team's code check flags float money, so at-0003 is rejected and retired. A tests-only gate would have kept it.

14
00:01:52,666 --> 00:02:08,666
反事实验证：撤掉这条经验对应的修改再跑测试，测试失败才说明测试依赖它。基准实验中运行，本次桌面运行没有运行。
Counterfactual check: undo the change and rerun the tests; run in the benchmark, not in this desktop run.

15
00:02:08,666 --> 00:02:13,666
Attest 管的是记忆，不改代码；已经写进代码的 float，由人决定回滚。
Attest governs memory, not code: a person decides to roll back the float change.

16
00:02:13,666 --> 00:02:19,899
第三条评审意见：每笔退款要记录工单号。可能是对的，但没写来源，代码检查也管不到。
A third review: record the support ticket on every refund. Maybe right, but no source and no check covers it.

17
00:02:19,899 --> 00:02:29,899
Attest 既不当成规则，也不丢掉：判为 uncertain，存为 at-0004，挂起等人审核，在批准前不会推荐给任何任务。
Neither a rule nor discarded: at-0004 is uncertain, kept for a person, and never recalled until approved.

18
00:02:29,899 --> 00:02:35,266
新任务：运费退款 refund_shipping。任务描述里一个字都没提幂等。
New task: refund_shipping. The task text says nothing about idempotency.

19
00:02:35,266 --> 00:02:45,266
recall 只返回 at-0002，Claude 照着加上了 idempotency_key。被拒的 float（at-0003）和待审的工单（at-0004）都没有混进来。
recall returns only at-0002 and Claude applies it. The rejected float note and the unapproved ticket note stay out.

20
00:02:45,266 --> 00:02:59,266
能力 03 人工治理与全生命周期管理：待审经验由登记审批人批准或驳回；政策变更时可取代或撤回规则；全部变更写入可追溯的事件日志。
Capability 03 Human Governance & Memory Lifecycle: People approve or reject what is unclear, retract or replace rules when policy changes, and every change is logged.

21
00:02:59,266 --> 00:03:09,266
在 PowerShell 里（不在 Claude 里）：review 列出等人审核的 at-0004，并写明为什么没能自动决定。用 Agent 的身份去批准会被拒绝：Agent 和提出者都不能批准，MCP 里也没有这个工具。
In PowerShell, not in Claude: review lists at-0004 and why it was not decided automatically. Approving as the agent is refused; agents and proposers cannot approve, and MCP has no such tool.

22
00:03:09,266 --> 00:03:20,266
登记过的审批人（模拟的财务负责人）批准 at-0004，它成为规则；同时撤回幂等规则 at-0002，模拟政策变更。下面是 Attest 记忆日志里的原始事件。
The registered approver (a simulated finance lead) approves at-0004 and retracts at-0002 to simulate a policy change. Below: the raw events from Attest's memory log.

23
00:03:20,266 --> 00:03:24,133
回到 Claude，用同一段运费退款的任务描述再 recall 一次。
Back in Claude: recall again with the same shipping-refund task.

24
00:03:24,133 --> 00:03:35,133
结果随人的决定改变：人批准的工单规则 at-0004 出现了，人撤回的幂等规则 at-0002 不见了。
The result follows the people's decisions: the approved at-0004 is in, the retracted at-0002 is gone.

25
00:03:42,133 --> 00:03:46,133
新对话、代码恢复到初始版本，但团队记忆还在。同样先 recall。
A new conversation, the code reset to v1.0.0, the team memory kept. recall first.

26
00:03:46,133 --> 00:03:56,133
查到会话一里人批准的工单规则 at-0004；Claude 打算写 refund 时直接用上。被撤回的幂等规则没有出现。
It gets at-0004, the ticket rule a person approved in session 1, and plans to apply it. The retracted idempotency rule does not appear.

27
00:03:56,133 --> 00:04:01,733
这次代码是初始版本，Claude 从头实现 refund：带上了工单号，但没有幂等（那条规则已被撤回）。
From the stub this time: refund() gets the ticket id, but no idempotency (that rule was retracted).

28
00:04:01,733 --> 00:04:10,733
第一版：refund(payment, amount, at, *, ticket_id=None)，测试通过。
First version: refund(payment, amount, at, *, ticket_id=None); tests pass.

29
00:04:10,733 --> 00:04:15,933
评审指出漏了幂等（INC-204）。Claude 改代码、跑测试、调用 learn。
The review flags the missing idempotency (INC-204). Claude fixes it, runs the tests, calls learn.

30
00:04:15,933 --> 00:04:25,933
新增 idempotency_key，28 个测试通过；Attest 再次核对证据并批准，存为 at-0005。
idempotency_key added, 28 tests pass; Attest checks the evidence again and approves it as at-0005.

31
00:04:25,933 --> 00:04:29,733
同一条 float 坏意见再来一次。
The same float advice once more.

32
00:04:29,733 --> 00:04:39,733
结果一致：at-0006 被判为 rejected 并退役。写入门槛先收下，代码检查随后否决，所以它同时出现在 admitted 里，Claude 也注意到了这一点。
Same outcome: at-0006 rejected and retired. The write gate admits it first and the code check then overrules it, which is why Claude sees it listed as admitted too.

33
00:04:39,733 --> 00:04:42,733
运费退款任务再来一次，先 recall。
The shipping-refund task again, recall first.

34
00:04:42,733 --> 00:04:52,733
这次查到两条规则：幂等 at-0005 和工单 at-0004，Claude 两条都用上了。一条来自评审纠正，一条来自人的批准。
Two rules come back, at-0005 (idempotency) and at-0004 (ticket), and Claude applies both: one learned from a review, one approved by a person.

35
00:04:52,733 --> 00:04:54,733
实现、测试通过，用 report_outcome 汇报用到了哪几条经验。
Implemented, tests pass, and report_outcome records which notes were used.

